message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: lyapower
abstract: >-
  Fit the 3D flux power spectrum of the Lyman-alpha forest from Nyx
  hydrodynamical simulations (post-processed by gimlet), implementing the
  Arinyo-i-Prats et al. 2015 non-linear models and the splicing method for
  combining simulation boxes of different resolution.
type: software
